    oe:quoteText "Take 1 gallon decoction of galls of spec. grav. 1·056. 18 ounces of flour, mix, boil into a paste, to which, when cool, add 8 ounces of the aceto-nitrate of iron of the preceding formula, and 1 quart of iron liquor of spec. grav. 1·110."@en ;
