    oe:quoteText "SPERMACETI: a kind of waxy body which separates in cold weather from the oil obtained from the head-matter of the sperm whale (Physeter macrocephalus). It is used for making candles with about 3 per cent. of bees'-wax added to prevent crystallization."@en ;
