    rdfs:label "Evidence for Tallow used in Shipbuilding, Rope, Cordage & Sailcloth: Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. F, F"@en ;
