    oe:quoteText "DIVI-DIVI: a commercial name for the wrinkled pods of the Casalpina coriaria, used in tanning."@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 140" ;
