    oe:quoteText "A committee of the Société d’Encouragement, of Paris, made researches upon the best composition for sizing paper in the vat, and gave the following recipe:-100 kilogrammes of dry paper stuff. 12 -- starch. 1 -- rosin, previously dissolved in 500 grammes of carbonate of soda. 18 pails of water."@en ;
